   "txt": "**1. Most Important Fact**\nShri G.M. Naidu, Senior Management Personnel (Manufacturing / Sr. General Manager / Chief of Operations), has resigned from Aarti Pharmalabs Limited and was relieved from his services effective from the close of business on August 31, 2026.\n\n**2. Key Numbers**\n* No financial numbers or contract values were disclosed in this filing.\n\n**3. Management Guidance / Outlook**\n* None stated in the document.\n\n**4. What a Shareholder Should Watch**\n* Any subsequent disclosure regarding the appointment of a successor or leadership transition plan for manufacturing and operations management.\n\n**5. One-Line Net Read**\n* **Neutral to marginally negative**: Routine departure of a senior operational/manufacturing personnel with no financial or broader strategic impact cited."
