  {
   "s": "ITC",
   "n": "ITC Limited",
   "cat": "Acquisition",
   "when": "2026-08-31 19:16",
   "sent": "positive",
   "txt": "### 1. Single Most Important Fact\nITC Limited\u2019s wholly owned subsidiary, **ITC Infotech India Limited (ITCI)**, will acquire a **22.106% equity stake** (3,36,61,700 shares) in **Happiest Minds Technologies Limited (HMTL)** from its promoters for **~\u20b91,330 crore in cash**, followed by a complete **amalgamation of HMTL into ITC Infotech**, leading to the **direct listing of ITC Infotech** on the BSE and NSE.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Key Numbers Exactly as Stated\n\n#### **Acquisition & Amalgamation Terms**\n* **Promoter Stake Purchase:** \u20b91,330 crore in two tranches:\n  * Tranche 1: 11.00% @ \u20b9390/share\n  * Tranche 2: 11.106% @ \u20b9400/share\n* **Funding:** Via a \u20b91,330 crore Rights Issue by ITC Infotech.\n* **Share Swap Ratio:** **25 ITCI shares (FV \u20b910) for every 81 HMTL shares (FV \u20b92)** (i.e., 1 ITCI share for every 3.24 HMTL shares).\n* **Implied Valuations:**\n  * HMTL: \u20b9405 per share (\u20b96,167 crore equity value)\n  * ITC Infotech: \u20b91,312 per share (\u20b911,920 crore pre-rights issue value)\n* **Post-Merger Shareholding:** ITC Limited: **~73.4%**, HMTL Promoters: **~7.6%**, HMTL Public Shareholders: **~19.0%**.\n\n#### **Standalone Entity Financials & Combined Scale**\n| Metric | ITC Infotech | Happiest Minds (HMTL) | Combined Entity |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **FY26 Revenue** | \u20b94,718 cr *(5Y CAGR: 14%)* | \u20b92,315.11 cr *(5Y CAGR: 25%)* | Pro-forma >\u20b97,000 cr |\n| **FY25 Revenue** | \u20b94,140 cr | \u20b92,060.84 cr | \u2014 |\n| **FY24 Revenue** | \u20b92,246 cr *(FY20)* | \u20b91,624.66 cr | \u2014 |\n| **FY26 PAT / Margins** | Adj. PAT: \u20b9510 cr; Adj. EBITDA margin: 18.5% | \u2014 | \u2014 |\n| **Employee Count** | 13,000+ | 6,500+ | 19,000+ |\n| **Americas Revenue Share** | 27% | 59% | 38% |\n| **BFSI Revenue Share** | 17% | 26% | 20% |\n\n---\n\n### 3. Management Guidance & Forward Statements\n* **Scale Target:** Envisages creating a scaled, future-ready, AI-first IT player reaching **US$ 1 billion in revenue by FY28** (on a pro-forma basis).\n* **Synergies:** Expects **~10% synergy revenue uplift** and **~100 bps margin expansion**.\n* **Earnings Impact:** Expected to be **EPS accretive** in the first full year of combined operations.\n\n---\n\n### 4. What a Shareholder Should Watch / Act On\n* **Regulatory & Statutory Approvals:** Clearances needed from the Competition Commission of India (CCI), SEBI/Stock Exchanges, Creditors/Shareholders, and NCLT.\n* **Execution Milestones:**\n  * **Q3 FY27:** Completion of Tranche 1 SPA.\n  * **Mar\u2013Apr 2027:** Completion of Tranche 2 SPA and shareholder/creditor meetings.\n  * **Q2\u2013Q3 FY28 (~15 months):** Final NCLT order and subsequent listing/trading of ITC Infotech shares.\n\n---\n\n### 5. One-Line Net Read\n**Positive**: Accelerates IT business scale toward US$ 1 billion, unlocks direct value discovery for ITC Infotech via a public listing, and enhances AI/digital capabilities without diluting ITC's controlling grip (~73.4% post-merger)."
  },
